  "title": "VirTra Sets Second Quarter 2026 Conference Call for Thursday, August 13, 2026 at 4:30 p.m. ET",
  "summary": "CHANDLER, Ariz. — August 3, 2026 — VirTra, Inc. (Nasdaq: VTSI) (“VirTra” or the “Company”), a global provider of judgmental use-of-force and firearms training simulators, will hold a conference call on Thursday, August 13, 2026 at 4:30 p.m. Eastern time (1:30 p.m. Pacific time) to discuss its financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026. […]",
